{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"1c1809dc5c0852a24fd2e98a16f1c48a0099bb5a8076dad64ee116379fb4b925","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["天上的敬拜"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["此後，我觀看，見天上有門開了。我初次聽見好像吹號的聲音，對我說：「你上到這裏來，我要將以後必成的事指示你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我立刻被聖靈感動，見有一個寶座安置在天上，又有一位坐在寶座上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["看那坐着的，好像碧玉和紅寶石；又有虹圍着寶座，好像綠寶石。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["寶座的周圍又有二十四個座位；其上坐着二十四位長老，身穿白衣，頭上戴着金冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["有閃電、聲音、雷轟從寶座中發出；又有七盞火燈在寶座前點着；這七燈就是上帝的七靈。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["寶座前好像一個玻璃海，如同水晶。 寶座中和寶座周圍有四個活物，前後遍體都滿了眼睛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第一個活物像獅子，第二個像牛犢，第三個臉面像人，第四個像飛鷹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["四活物各有六個翅膀，遍體內外都滿了眼睛。他們晝夜不住地說：",{"text":"聖哉！聖哉！聖哉！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主上帝是昔在、今在、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以後永在的全能者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["每逢四活物將榮耀、尊貴、感謝歸給那坐在寶座上、活到永永遠遠者的時候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那二十四位長老就俯伏在坐寶座的面前敬拜那活到永永遠遠的，又把他們的冠冕放在寶座前，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"我們的主，我們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是配得榮耀、尊貴、權柄的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你創造了萬物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且萬物是因你的旨意被創造而有的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}